Z||000017||Butter||09-18-2001||05:14 PM||||When you got a chicken hawk that won't stay out of the hen house, you shoot and kill him least you run out of eggs real quick.<P>We must remember this country is dealing with a MUCH different culture than our own.<P>We must fight fire with fire and I say kill Bin and the next martyr and so on.  Sure glad to be able to say that in English and not Hitler type German.<P>Archie, do you think Bin would pass up the chance to take out President Bush.<P>Wise up.  WAR IS HELL!!!||||reg||4
