Z||000023||Leper||09-18-2001||11:49 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Butter:<BR><B>Archie, do you think Bin would pass up the chance to take out President Bush.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Would the assasination of GW stop this country?<P>  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Patrick's Dad:<BR><B>BTW, the National Socialist Party of Germany were similarly indoctrinated. Hitler did not become a martyr, except to some idiots here in the US....</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I don't remember Hitler being assasinated. I thought that he killed himself when he lost the war.<P>I don't think that it would be possible for Bin Laden to be tried for his crimes. They would never be able to find anyone impartial to try the case. So he's as good as dead anyway.<p>[This message has been edited by Leper (edited 09-19-2001).]||||reg||1
