Z||000031||Sootah||09-19-2001||01:15 PM||||Just think, how would the Soviets have reacted to this? They woulda bombed/nuked the hell out of the area. Did terrorists ever do anything like this to the Soviets? No. Not that there werent bombings and all that, but they sure as hell wouldn't have tried something like this to them. Jihad or not.<P>Can't we act like crazy communist retalitory bastards just once? This is not a situation where we should capture Bin Laden and put him in couseling. Take the motherfùcker out. (Or put him in a Mexican prison) Only so many new leaders will arise when a week later they get napalmed or shot in the head or whatnot. Express ride to Allah is only good looking for the first few martyrs.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/halfpole.gif">   <BR><I>Never pull your pants down in Cosco, the dang monkeys will getcha</I> <BR><B>AIM</B>: KSSouter||||reg||1
